e $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3a+3b+4c &= 3(-5i-2j) + 3(-2i-j) + 4(2i+3j) \\\\\n&= -15i - 6j - 6i - 3j + 8i + 12j \\\\\n&= (-15i - 6i + 8i) + (-6j - 3j + 12j) \\\\\n&= -13i + 3j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509430 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "078ac469-9a04-55c1-bbd4-74dc456ebd43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30i - 34j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509353} {:answer/id #uuid "17402bd4-1817-59fd-b737-f6f0f2650050" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30i + 12j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509357} {:answer/id #uuid "5a94333d-e271-5cc1-bfe0-aec4e55701a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21i - 25j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509381} {:answer/id #uuid "c342546e-0bc0-5b8d-991e-150f7692d7e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3i - 34j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509424} {:answer/id #uuid "fb08f295-e005-57af-8755-af8da6aaf317" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6i - 42j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509448}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "078ac469-9a04-55c1-bbd4-74dc456ebd43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30i - 34j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509353} :answer-field/id #uuid "f5fb0147-4afa-5b11-9693-0b0311d3df04" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509446}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d4845205-9834-571a-844c-fb4721f39742" :question/problem "Find $-2a-4b+4c$ if $a=-3i+3j$, $b=-3i+8j$, and $c=3i+j$." :question/worked-solution "To compute $-2a-4b+4c,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-2a-4b+4c &= -2(-3i+3j) - 4(-3i+8j) + 4(3i+j) \\\\\n&= 6i - 6j + 12i - 32j + 12i + 4j \\\\\n&= (6i + 12i + 12i) + (-6j - 32j + 4j) \\\\\n&= 30i - 34j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509432