1,-8⟩$. Find $a - 2b$." :question/worked-solution "To compute $a - 2b$, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na - 2b &= ⟨14,-11⟩ - 2\\cdot ⟨11,-8⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨14,-11⟩ - ⟨22,-16⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨14 - 22, -11 - (-16)⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-8,5⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509578 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "137e5695-1835-540d-8c8f-4ff43e4350a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨14, -12⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509560} {:answer/id #uuid "24091cba-5b20-5e10-b58e-8d25454d6f08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨ - 8, -12⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509564} {:answer/id #uuid "2fa6094b-8a83-5aa4-94cc-b745ccd648f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨ - 14, -14⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509567} {:answer/id #uuid "80b1e821-875f-542e-9ec3-c9aefef2558f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨ - 14, -12⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509591} {:answer/id #uuid "ca5a4d46-3d39-57c7-bb9d-e19cb5282be2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨ - 8, -14⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509611}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "80b1e821-875f-542e-9ec3-c9aefef2558f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨ - 14, -12⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509591} :answer-field/id #uuid "5e7500dd-f622-5044-9cff-178cf5f924fe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509582}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "5191eb52-5ce5-51e8-8db0-71d02ead17cb" :question/problem "If $u = ⟨ - 11, -13⟩$ and $v = ⟨3,-1⟩$, then $u - v =$" :question/worked-solution "To compute $u - v$, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nu - v &= ⟨-11,-13⟩ - ⟨3,-1⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-11 - 3, -13 - (-1)⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-14,-12⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$